{
  "id": "surging-sparks-build-battle-box",
  "name": "Surging Sparks Build & Battle Box",
  "category": "product_promotion",
  "description": {
    "text": "Given to players at the Surging Sparks prerelease tournaments on the weekends of 26–27 October and 2–3 November 2024, and sold by shops in the Prerelease Program. Each box held four Surging Sparks booster packs and a 40-card deck built around one of four promos with the Surging Sparks logo. The decks also held non-holo copies of Rabsca, Gouging Fire and Tapu Koko, which booster packs have only in holofoil, and Scarlet & Violet's non-holo Professor's Research (Professor Sada's).",
